### Nexus HR & IT Asset Manager API Verification Suite
### Works natively with VS Code REST Client extension or HTTP tools

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. SIWE Nonce Generation Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/nonce?address=0x15d34AAf54267DB7D7c367839AAf71A00a2C6A65
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. SIWE Signature Verification (Sign-In with Ethereum)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0x15d34AAf54267DB7D7c367839AAf71A00a2C6A65",
  "signature": "0x98127391823791823",
  "nonce": "nexus_nonce_demo"
}

###

### 4. SSO Frictionless Onboarding (Account Abstraction & DID creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sso-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol.danvers@nexus.corp",
  "name": "Carol Danvers",
  "department": "Quantum Infrastructure"
}

###

### 5. Issue IT Equipment & Provision Printable QR Code Sticker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientEmail": "carol.danvers@nexus.corp",
  "assetName": "Quantum-Resistant Enclave HSM",
  "description": "Enterprise Grade Cryptographic Hardware Token for Zero-Trust Access Control",
  "serialNumber": "SN-QUANTUM-2026-X9",
  "category": "Hardware Security Module",
  "isLocked": true,
  "warrantyExpiry": "2029-06-30"
}

###

### 6. Verify Physical Asset via Serial Number Bridge (QR Scanner Mock Endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/verify/SN-TITAN-9012-CYBER
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Trigger Web2 API Webhook Relayer (GitHub & Kisi Physical Access Control)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ENGINEERING_ROLE",
  "userEmail": "carol.danvers@nexus.corp",
  "employeeName": "Carol Danvers"
}

###

### 8. Fetch Audit Logs for Webhook Web2 Relayer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/logs
Content-Type: application/json
